{
  "name": "OeIntegration_15min",
  "description": "Short OE-integration test, ~15 min. Purpose: confirm the BLE OE sensor's mic captures land in /oe_samples without changing the sweep skip count, before committing to a 13 h run. Motor turns (500-1200 rpm, open loop) so the sensor sees a running bearing; no temperature setpoints, so the heater stays out of it. NOTE: the UL probe is detached (ticket 0015), so CHAN1 records a normal-looking but meaningless trace in this run - it is not a data run.",
